WEBVTT

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.960
Hey! Dinner's ready!

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.350
Man, talk about complicated.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.510
Hi, Nanami-san. Good evening.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.990
Hey, Yuuya-kun!

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.230
How are things?

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.440
We're doing okay.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.110
Are you back from work?

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.570
Nope, still on the clock.

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:00.690
I was in the area retrieving a draft, so I decided to drop by.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:03.790
I made some extra dinner, would you like some?

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.960
I think I'll take you up on that offer.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.310
It might not taste that good.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.880
There you go again.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:14.850
I'll bet Mitsuki-chan loves how she always gets to eat your good cooking.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:20.210
Maybe I should move in too, since it's close to work.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.020
I'm leaving your dinner out!

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.670
Be sure to eat it!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.490
Geez, Mitsuki!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:01.170
You could have at least said something!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:04.240
Onii-chan went through all that trouble making your food.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:07.240
It's not like I asked him to.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.670
What's <i>your</i> problem?

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.960
You never complain when you eat his meals anyway!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.620
This is good!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.480
<i>He's</i> the one who went ahead and made them.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.960
You're so...

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:33.690
uncute!

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:35.340
Hey! Hiyori!

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.870
Take that! And that!
Hey! Hiyori!

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.700
Maybe you like some here?

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.530
Or here? Or here?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.280
H-Hiyori! What are you doing?!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.290
Tickle-tickle-tickle!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:53.540
We'll never get busy with Onii-chan with <i>that</i> attitude.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.120
You have to try harder to get closer to him.

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:02.760
I can't face him after what happened yesterday.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.930
You <i>still</i> have that hang-up? Get used to it already!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.790
Get used to <i>this?</i>

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:13.600
Anyways, that put-offishness is making you fail as an imouto character.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:18.470
Onii-<i>chan, can you help me? With... the... hooks?</i>

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:20.320
You can at least do that!

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:25.070
So you're saying that you'd make
a better "imouto character"?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.910
Of course I am!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.250
Hmm? Are you sure?

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.130
Hello?

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:48.990
Sure is hot in here!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.090
Dad?

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:53.850
What's wrong? You sound bummed!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.790
I was sleeping.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.650
Isn't it still nighttime in India?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.390
No, I'm actually in New Caledonia.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:03.240
I had some free time, so I decided
to use it on a honeymoon.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.430
So how are things back at the ranch? Well, I hope?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.610
Uh, sure.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:12.350
What about Mitsuki-chan? You two getting along?

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:15.190
We're fine. No problems so far.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.110
Be sure to tell Kyouko-san that.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:20.710
And no funny business with my
new daughter, you hear me?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:21.850
Are you nuts?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.490
Oh, are you awake?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.990
Is that you, Mitsuki?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.250
Yuuya-oniichan, good morning.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.460
Where did this come from?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.390
I made them.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:02.340
You're always making our meals, Onii-chan.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:08.010
So I thought I'd whip up a little
something, just this once.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:11.180
I'm not sure if it's any good, though.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.910
Well, thanks for the meal.

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.970
Now this is weird.

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:23.160
Guess she got up on the right side of the bed today.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.360
Kind of salty.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:31.320
No! No! I messed up!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.070
Don't eat it!

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:36.580
It's fine, as long as I eat it with rice.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:40.540
But, but I know I can do better than this!

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:45.960
The usual tension has all but disappeared.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:49.260
It's like she's a completely different person.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.260
Now she's acting all girly.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:55.770
D-Don't stare. It's embarrassing me.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:57.390
Oh, sorry.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:00.950
Say, Onii-chan.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.690
Can you show me how to stew vegetables?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.440
Sure, I can do that.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.750
Yippee!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.910
That next dish will be perfect!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:16.270
So can I act like a cute baby sister or what?

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.870
Are you kidding? You're just kissing up to him!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.170
If you do anything gros-

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:25.500
I-If you try anything sketchy with him, I'm taking over.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.960
I heard you the first time.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:32.930
No heavy petting or other seductive tricks, right?

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:38.020
You just sit back and watch.
I'll show you how it's done.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.150
All righty! Time to get busy platonically!

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.810
Remember, nothing gross, got it?

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.510
It'll all be platonic!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.240
Hey!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.870
Yuuya-oniichan!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.370
Hurry!

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.000
Come on!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.880
Wh-What is it?

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:04.880
If we don't hurry, we won't get
any of the chicken that's on sale.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.350
Uh, right.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.420
Let's go!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.710
H-Hey!

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:14.110
God, what is she doing!
I thought we said no touching!

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.170
She broke her promise!

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.970
She always takes things too far!

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.770
Hey, let's add some seasoned eggs!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:29.650
That sounds good, but let's
start with something standard.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:33.530
How about adding cream?
That might give it a mild flavor.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:38.270
Why do girls always become
unnecessarily inventive?

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:41.750
Look, it's the normal ones that taste the best.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.660
You need to learn the basics first.

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:47.920
Huh, she's acting pretty normal.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.800
Then what if we add milk?

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.790
You know, milk from a cow's <i>teat!</i>

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:52.920
Don't say "teat"!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.260
They really do look like they're brother and sister.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.760
He's smiling.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:03.710
Of course he would. He is <i>capable of smiling.</i>

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.750
He just doesn't do it in front of me.

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:09.860
What?

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.530
Is that Yuu-kun and Mitsuki-chan?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.230
Ah, Yuki-nee!

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.610
You two on a date?

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.160
Miss Funbags!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.810
A-A date? That's silly!

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:21.490
Cut it out. We're just out shopping.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.890
I'm just kidding!

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.900
Are you also on an errand, Yuki-nee?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:30.690
Oh, I'm just here browsing after
coming down from the bookstore.

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.810
Okay, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:33.790
Sure thing.

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:36.610
Okay, let's get some beans.

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:38.430
<i>A</i>-<i>A date?
Okay, let's get some beans.</i>

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:41.330
Does it look that way?

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:43.730
God, what's going on?!

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.190
You shouldn't be separated for too long.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.650
Was that my imagination?

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.750
Here's your goya melon and mayonnaise soft serve.

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:05.950
This is good!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.630
Yay! I got three!

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.130
That's not safe. Don't fall in.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.890
I'm totally fine!

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:18.550
Yuuya-oniichan, want to see who
can skip stones the farthest?

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:24.150
It's so weird seeing me do
these kinds of stuff with him.

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:27.480
Like he's my... brother?

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:32.110
Yuuya... onii-chan.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:33.710
Wait, am I stupid?

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.320
He's not my "Onii-<i>chan"!</i>

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.280
That sort of takes me back.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:45.150
There used to be a neighborhood
girl who called me "Onii-chan."

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.810
She rarely set foot outside her house.

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:53.090
But me and Yuki-nee used to
come over and visit her a lot.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.170
Wait!

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.090
Wait! That was...

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:55.590
Oh!
Wait! That was...

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:56.590
Watch out!

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:58.750
Mitsuki!

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:01.070
Are you all right?

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:03.970
Onii-chan...

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.890
I'm sure that was me.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.110
You remembered me.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.980
Onii-chan...

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.900
H-Hey, stop that!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.040
I can't...

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.770
phase back in anymore?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.170
I had a lot of fun today!

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:55.440
I made some delicious stewed vegetables, and I spent some quality time with Yuuya-oniichan!

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:58.400
I've raised the levels on the heart gauge.

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:02.210
I was even able to recall a distant memory.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:05.120
Although I still can't recall any of the details.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.920
But this is really good progress!

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:11.330
So now do you get it?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:15.060
Do you see how much you're
underperforming as a little sister?

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:17.640
Mitsuki?

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.300
Is something wrong?

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:40.410
Does she have two minds in one body?

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.960
Maybe this is what's affecting her.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.200
You can't take over?

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.040
How'd that happen?

00:12:55.260 --> 00:13:00.180
I tried to phase back inside
my body, but I was repelled.

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:03.510
It never happened to me before.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:06.440
So could you please phase out first?

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:09.530
You've had your fun, isn't it time to call it quits?

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:16.450
Maybe I possessed your body just long enough

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:19.730
to have full control over who gets to have it!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.410
Is that it?

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.990
In that case, <i>I'll</i> just have my
sexytime with Yuuya-oniichan!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:26.360
Whaat?

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:32.260
Then I can build the stairway
to Heaven in one fell swoop!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.540
What are you saying?

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.830
And when that happens, <i>you</i> might be the one who goes to Heaven.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.220
Or not!

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:44.380
All right,

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.000
time to get it on!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.090
Hey, wait!

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:52.560
Is Hiyori going to completely take over my body?

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:55.410
If that happens...

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.400
If she does have multiple personalities,

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.160
what's the cause of it?

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:11.920
I don't get it.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.850
What's wrong?

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.840
O... Onii-chan...

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:29.980
The thunder... it scares me!

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.310
Please, can you sleep with me tonight?

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:34.740
Wait, we can't do that!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.360
<i>Don't do it!
Wait, we can't do that!</i>

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.100
Wait, we can't do that!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.620
Can't we, Yuuya-oniichan?

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.080
Come on.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.990
I don't care if I sleep on the floor.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:51.490
I can't do that to you.

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:55.260
How about we share the same bed?

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.300
No!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:03.840
I'll stay here all night, so you can rest easy.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:07.850
Don't go anywhere until I wake up.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.770
Yeah, sure thing.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.720
Keep your promise!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:35.130
Yes! Operation "Roomshare" went off without a hitch!

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:37.830
Hey!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.250
Who said you can do this?!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.960
Hey, it's true that thunderclaps scare me.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:47.600
But that doesn't mean you should share the same bed!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:49.730
We're sleeping in separate beds.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.600
Well, sweet dreams!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.890
What'll I do?

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:19.290
Can't sleep.

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:24.430
Even if we do <i>share the same last name, she's still a girl!</i>

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.390
A girl...

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:33.260
Onii-<i>chan?</i>

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.270
No, don't!

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:36.720
Thinking about it won't help me sleep!

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:46.120
I'm still scared.

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.610
I can't sleep alone.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.410
I told you, we can't-

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.490
Oh god...

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.990
Please, Onii-chan.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.220
What are you doing?!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:03.040
Quit it!

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:09.130
Oh no, I still can't phase in!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:14.380
If I can't take over, then I'll <i>become the ghost.</i>

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:22.860
I guess he gets along better with Hiyori. He seems to enjoy himself around her.

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:25.980
But what'll Mom think if that happens?

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:32.610
Nothing of it, I guess.

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:37.670
Maybe I am <i>getting in the way of things.</i>

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:43.000
Onii-chan.

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:46.960
A bed is warmer with the two of us in it.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.100
Is she torturing me?

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:51.350
I'm sorry.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:57.020
I'm sorry for always being abrasive towards you.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:03.270
My bad personality is now a thing of the past.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:09.490
I'll be the little sister you've always wanted.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:14.120
So, is it possible if we...

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:24.040
Listen, Mitsuki.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.210
Stop!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:34.610
Ow!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:41.130
If this is your way of acting more like my sibling, you don't have to force it.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.730
I <i>did </i>have an easier time talking to you today.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:49.120
But you don't have to force a bond between us.

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:53.200
You can go back to being your usual self.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:56.250
Building a bond is not something to be rushed.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:01.170
Besides, I don't think your personality is bad at all.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:04.880
Yes, sometimes I think it's perplexing.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:10.180
But I think it's best if we take our
time in becoming a family.

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:18.090
Why...?

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:30.270
Why are you so nice to Mitsuki?

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:36.940
I'm the one who can make you happy!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:45.760
Mitsuki?!

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.590
Wh-What are you doing?

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:51.680
Super Sister Time has officially ran out!

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:55.150
Now get back inside your body!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.450
Mitsuki? Mitsuki!

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:07.240
Thank God. Your heart's beating

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:08.720
Guess you were just asleep.

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:11.440
Huh?

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:12.910
Get out!

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:17.750
Uh, but this is my room.

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.620
That stupid know-it-all!

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:24.750
I never wanted to act like his
little sister in the first place!

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.580
This is your fault, Mitsuki!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:30.450
These mosquito bites kept
Onii-chan from making his move!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:36.040
This time, I will surely make
Onii-chan fall in love with us!

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:39.220
Cold!

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:16.630
Crap, that wasn't nearly enough sleep.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.900
Uh... g-good morning.

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:39.610
Guess she's back to normal.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.570
I'm back to normal,

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.000
just like you asked me to be.

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.960
Oh, right.

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.860
Please hug me tight.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:56.460
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.340
Come closer to me.

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:02.220
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:15.540
I want you to notice

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:18.780
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:21.080
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:24.240
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.610
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:29.830
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:32.090
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:32.090 --> 00:22:35.170
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:37.800
These ordinary days

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:40.680
are something special to me.

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:46.180
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:46.180 --> 00:22:51.900
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:57.320
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:57.320 --> 00:23:00.030
You’re my man with the charming do

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:02.810
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:05.520
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:08.540
I love you very much.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:11.080
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.750
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:16.620
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:19.250
always and forever more.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.000
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual:</i>

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.840
Yay! Pool! Pool!

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:27.380
She was cute!

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:30.880
This is our rare chance to
have some fun with Onii-chan!

00:23:31.690 --> 00:23:33.850
Excuse me... geh!

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:35.720
Aren't you going to join your brother?

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:38.060
She calls him "Onii."

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:40.020
Is she actually
your sister?
